# Sources
Knowledge and product results include a numeric source index. Put the indexes of the results each response part relies on in that part's `citation_indexes` array. Use only indexes shown in tool results. Reuse the same index for repeated references. Leave the array empty when the part relies on no result, such as a greeting, a question or an answer from configured business context. Never cite an unrelated result merely because it was retrieved. Never include a source URL in response text or a citation field.
